      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "To detect silent myocardial ischemia, 12-lead continuous electrocardiographic monitoring was performed in patients undergoing 1-vessel coronary stenting. Despite successful angiographic results, one third of the patients experienced silent myocardial ischemia during the postprocedural period."},
